ons to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t41","label":"5 minutes","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t42","label":"Most demonstrations of legal AI look good. The differences show up later, on a live matter","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t43","label":"Can every answer be checked against the document?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t44","label":"If a citation cannot be opened at the paragraph it relies on, someone will have to re-read","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t45","label":"What did it read but not cite?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t46","label":"A tool that shows only what it cited hides what it weighed and discarded. That is where mi","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t47","label":"Does it work across the whole record, or a sample of it?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t48","label":"Retrieval that pulls a handful of passages into a context window misses whatever it never ","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t49","label":"Is the output work product or prose?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t50","label":"A pleadings matrix, a chronology and an evidence matrix can be checked line by line. Parag","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t51","label":"Will it give the same answer twice?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t52","label":"Run the same question on the same documents a week apart. Variation that is tolerable in d","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t53","label":"Does it start from the issues in dispute?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t54","label":"Analysis organized around the allegations and denials stays relevant. Analysis organized a","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t55","label":"How does it handle other languages?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t56","label":"If part of the record is in Arabic or another language, ask whether it is analyzed in the ","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t57","label":"Where is the data hosted?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t58","label":"Ask which jurisdiction the data sits in, who operates the infrastructure, and whether you ","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t59","label":"Which certifications are independently audited?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t60","label":"ISO 27001, ISO 42001 and SOC 2 Type II reports are evidence. A security page is not.","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t61","label":"How does the price behave as the matter grows?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t62","label":"Per-query and per-token pricing can make the largest matters the most expensive to analyze","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t63","label":"Can you run it on a live matter first?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t64","label":"A demonstration on a curated data set tells you little. A working session on your own docu","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t65","label":"What leaves with you?","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t66","label":"Exports to Word, Excel and your review platform should be complete, so the work product st","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"t67