roup":"Navigation"},{"key":"l10","label":"Platform","group":"Navigation"},{"key":"l11","label":"Languages","group":"Navigation"},{"key":"l12","label":"Security","group":"Navigation"},{"key":"l13","label":"Pricing","group":"Navigation"},{"key":"l14","label":"Insights","group":"Navigation"},{"key":"l15","label":"Book a working session","group":"Navigation"},{"key":"l16","label":"sales@cicero.com.ai","group":"Navigation"},{"key":"l17","label":"← Insights","group":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI."},{"key":"l18","label":"/","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l19","label":"Platform","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l20","label":"Languages","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l21","label":"Security","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l22","label":"Pricing","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l23","label":"All insights","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l24","label":"Matter analysis","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l25","label":"Methodology note","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l26","label":"Buyer's guide","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l27","label":"Book a working session","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l28","label":"LinkedIn ↗","group":"Footer & contact"},{"key":"l29","label":"Privacy policy ↗","group":"Footer & contact"}],"defaults":{"text":{"t0":"New","t1":"Cicero now translates the record across languages.","t2":"See how it works","t3":"Platform","t4":"Languages","t5":"Security","t6":"Pricing","t7":"Insights","t8":"English","t9":"English","t10":"EN","t11":"العربية","t12":"AR","t13":"Français","t14":"FR","t15":"Deutsch","t16":"DE","t17":"Español","t18":"ES","t19":"Italiano","t20":"IT","t21":"Português","t22":"PT","t23":"Book a session","t24":"Menu","t25":"Cicero","t26":"Platform","t27":"Languages","t28":"Security","t29":"Pricing","t30":"Insights","t31":"Book a working session","t32":"sales@cicero.com.ai","t33":"Matter analysis for claims, disputes and investigations","t34":"Insights","t35":"Guide","t36":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI","t37":"A short list for disputes partners and innovation teams. The answers separate tools you can rely on in a hearing from tools you will end up re-checking.","t38":"By","t39":"Joe Rayment, Founder and CEO","t40":"Reading time","t41":"5 minutes","t42":"Most demonstrations of legal AI look good. The differences show up later, on a live matter, when someone has to rely on the output. These questions are designed to surface those differences early.","t43":"Can every answer be checked against the document?","t44":"If a citation cannot be opened at the paragraph it relies on, someone will have to re-read the source anyway.","t45":"What did it read but not cite?","t46":"A tool that shows only what it cited hides what it weighed and discarded. That is where missed evidence lives.","t47":"Does it work across the whole record, or a sample of it?","t48":"Retrieval that pulls a handful of passages into a context window misses whatever it never retrieved. Ask how it decides what to read.","t49":"Is the output work product or prose?","t50":"A pleadings matrix, a chronology and an evidence matrix can be checked line by line. Paragraphs of fluent prose cannot.","t51":"Will it give the same answer twice?","t52":"Run the same question on the same documents a week apart. Variation that is tolerable in drafting is a risk in evidence.","t53":"Does it start from the issues in dispute?","t54":"Analysis organized around the allegations and denials stays relevant. Analysis organized around keywords drifts.","t55":"How does it handle other languages?","t56":"If part of the record is in Arabic or another language, ask whether it is analyzed in the original and whether translations stay linked to the source.","t57":"Where is the data hosted?","t58":"Ask which jurisdiction the data sits in, who operates the infrastructure, and whether you can choose.","t59":"Which certifications are independently audited?","t60":"ISO 27001, ISO 42001 and SOC 2 Type II reports are evidence. A security page is not.","t61":"How does the price behave as the matter grows?","t62":"Per-query and per-token pricing can make the largest matters the most expensive to analyze properly. Ask for the price of a matter twice the size.","t63":"Can you run it on a live matter first?","t64":"A demonstration on a curated data set tells you little. A working session on your own documents tells you a lot.","t65":"What leaves with you?","t66":"Exports to Word, Excel and your review platform should be complete, so the work product stays yours.","t67":"Cicero is the matter analysis platform for claims, disputes and investigations, built by Automatise in Sydney. In use at 50+ firms worldwide and hosted in eight regions.","t68":"Product","t69":"Platform","t70":"Languages","t71":"Security","t72":"Pricing","t73":"Insights","t74":"All insights","t75":"Matter analysis","t76":"Methodology note","t77":"Buyer's guide","t78":"Company","t79":"Book a working session","t80":"LinkedIn","t81":"Privacy policy","t82":"© 2026 Automatise","t83":"Hosted in the US, Australia, Canada, the UK, Europe, Singapore, Hong Kong and the UAE","t84":"L27 One International Towers, Barangaroo NSW 2000"},"images":{"i0":{"src":"/images/pen.jpg","alt":"","position":"50% 50%"}},"links":{"l0":"/languages","l1":"/","l2":"/platform","l3":"/languages","l4":"/security","l5":"/pricing","l6":"/insights","l7":"/demo","l8":"/","l9":"/","l10":"/platform","l11":"/languages","l12":"/security","l13":"/pricing","l14":"/insights","l15":"/demo","l16":"mailto:sales@cicero.com.ai","l17":"/insights","l18":"/","l19":"/platform","l20":"/languages","l21":"/security","l22":"/pricing","l23":"/insights","l24":"/insights/post-matter-analysis","l25":"/insights/research-four-ways","l26":"/insights/guide-twelve-questions","l27":"/demo","l28":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/automatise/","l29":"https://www.cicero.com.ai/privacy-policy"}},"title":"Twelve questions to ask before you buy litigation AI · Cicero","description":"Cicero is the matter analysis platform for claims, disputes and investigations, from the first production to the hearing."}